<title>UK: Misys says H1 pretax profit up 23 pct.</title>
<headline>Misys says H1 pretax profit up 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Nov 30, 1996</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		20.3		   vs 16.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.57		   vs 3.97</p>
<p> Pretax		     23.7		   vs 19.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   142.8		  vs 129.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name of British software applications group is Misys Plc. The company said it expected strong further progress with &quot;strong order books&quot;.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
